     "procedural_history": "",
     "attorneys": "Solicitor General Olson argued the cause for petitioner. With him on the briefs were Assistant Attorney General Keisler, Deputy Solicitor General Kneedler, Irving L. Gorn-stein, Barbara L. Herwig, Charles W. Scarborough, and August E. Flentje., Ann E. Beeson argued the cause for respondents. With her on the brief were Christopher A. Hansen, Steven R. Shapiro, Stefan Presser, Christopher R. Harris, and David L. Sobel.*",
     "nature_of_suit": "",
     "posture": "",
     "syllabus": "",
     "headnotes": "",
